    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking Offers in Excess of 525,000\n\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis is a really fine 268 sqm family home in a much-sought after address in Wexford.\nBallyhit is a short drive from Wexford town and has easy access to local amenities and the N25.\nThis home has a host of great features including many rooms with double aspect, three reception rooms, large kitchen area, utility and guest WC downstairs. There is also a large bedroom on the ground floor right beside the family bathroom.\nUpstairs is a large bright landing area with three generous double bedrooms, one of which has an en-suite. Also on this floor is the family shower room and a large hot press.\nThis family home is set on a beautifully mature site of almost 0.9 acres with mature planting, grassed area, a south facing patio and clearly defined boundaries (also with a stream running along the NE boundary). There are also two very handy utility sheds on the site.\nThis is a home that is full of natural light and with lots of space to accommodate various age groups, working from home options - in fact, whatever a family might need.\nOFCH, bio-crete septic system, mains water, broadband."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.4m x 6.2m + 2.2m 2.2m\nwith tiled floor, feature staircase with open balcony area from the landing. Naturally bright with windows either side of the front door\n\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 5.0m\ndouble aspect room with two front-facing windows and one to the side garden. Electric fire is place in previously open fireplace with mahogany and marble insert. Carpet flooring\n\nSitting Room - 4.4m x 5.8m\ndouble aspect room with square bay window onto the side garden and rear window. Laminate flooring, solid fuel stove in marble surround\n\nKitchen - 4.3m x 6.8m\ndouble aspect room with tiled flooring and splashback. Pine fitted waist and eye level units with island return. Access to utility area and dining room\n\nDining Room - 4.0m x 4.3m\naccessed from hallway or via French doors from the kitchen. Laminate flooring and two side facing windows\n\nUtility Room - 4.3m x 3m\nwith tiled floor, waist level units and pantry unit, sink, rear door and rear facing window\n\nGuest WC - 1.75m x 1.1m\nwith tiled floor, WC, WHB\n\nBathroom - 3m x 2.5m\ntiled floor and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB, bath, separate mains shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.5m x 3.5m\nwith laminate flooring and two front-facing windows\n\nLanding - 3.5m x 2.5m and 2m x 1.6m\nwith carpet flooring and attic hatch\n\nBedroom 2 - 5m x 4.8m\nwith timber flooring and front-facing dormer window\n\nShower Room - 2.5m x 2m\nwith linoleum flooring, skylight, WC, WHB, electric shower and eaves storage\n\nBedroom 3 - 5m x 4.4m\nwith timber flooring and eaves storage\n\nHot Press - 1.8m x 1.5m\ngreat storage area, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 7m x 6.4m\nwith timber flooring, dormer windows front and back, eaves storage.Measurement includes en-suite\n\nEn-Suite - \nlinoleum flooring, WC, WHB, mains shower\n\nOUTISDE - \n\n\nAdman Shed - 3m x 3m\nwith concrete floor and shelving\n\nTimber Shed - 3.6m x 2.4m\nhouses the old well system and has power\n\n"
      },
      {
